# OMDb API key — SERVER-ONLY. Never prefix with NEXT_PUBLIC_.
# Used by src/lib/omdb.ts to fetch homepage movie/series metadata (server-side, cached).
# Get a free key at https://www.omdbapi.com/apikey.aspx
# Copy this file to .env.local and fill in your own value (and set it in Vercel).
# Do NOT commit the real key.
OMDB_API_KEY=your_omdb_api_key
